    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553190/extras/99d185d7baa84aff3857645742a56d73.avif?t=1694191777\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE THE HIDDEN WORLD</strong></h2>Delve into the world of hidden mysteries and arcane forces as you master your own understanding of Mana and the forces that secretly shape reality.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553190/extras/0f6ac66e43d349900ff39be76bb330cd.poster.avif?t=1694191777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553190/extras/0f6ac66e43d349900ff39be76bb330cd.webm?t=1694191777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553190/extras/0f6ac66e43d349900ff39be76bb330cd.mp4?t=1694191777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CULTIVATE ALLIES</strong></h2>Forge alliances, friends, and rivalries.  You might even commit yourself in a Pact with some ancient being as a source of power in return for some sacrifice.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPAND YOUR BASE OF POWER</strong></h2>After leaving the University, find a home location and create your sanctuary. Or wander the earth as a nomad mage, relying on your own cunning, the kindness of strangers, and loyalty of your allies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553190/extras/fce5ef1baa1e278072e14a40891c2271.poster.avif?t=1694191777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553190/extras/fce5ef1baa1e278072e14a40891c2271.webm?t=1694191777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553190/extras/fce5ef1baa1e278072e14a40891c2271.mp4?t=1694191777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Random events and generative enemies ensure each play-through will be unique<br></li><li> Roll your character's attributes or choose from 5 templates, such as the Magus, each with their own strengths and weaknesses<br></li><li> Handle challenges with your own play style; direct confrontation is not the only way to get things done!<br></li><li> <strong>Mods</strong> Using a deep but simple to understand data system, modders can easily create their own events and storylines.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553190/extras/99d185d7baa84aff3857645742a56d73.avif?t=1694191777\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE THE HIDDEN WORLD</strong></h2>Delve into the world of hidden mysteries and arcane forces as you master your own understanding of Mana and the forces that secretly shape reality.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553190/extras/0f6ac66e43d349900ff39be76bb330cd.poster.avif?t=1694191777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553190/extras/0f6ac66e43d349900ff39be76bb330cd.webm?t=1694191777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553190/extras/0f6ac66e43d349900ff39be76bb330cd.mp4?t=1694191777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CULTIVATE ALLIES</strong></h2>Forge alliances, friends, and rivalries.  You might even commit yourself in a Pact with some ancient being as a source of power in return for some sacrifice.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPAND YOUR BASE OF POWER</strong></h2>After leaving the University, find a home location and create your sanctuary. Or wander the earth as a nomad mage, relying on your own cunning, the kindness of strangers, and loyalty of your allies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553190/extras/fce5ef1baa1e278072e14a40891c2271.poster.avif?t=1694191777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553190/extras/fce5ef1baa1e278072e14a40891c2271.webm?t=1694191777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553190/extras/fce5ef1baa1e278072e14a40891c2271.mp4?t=1694191777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Random events and generative enemies ensure each play-through will be unique<br></li><li> Roll your character's attributes or choose from 5 templates, such as the Magus, each with their own strengths and weaknesses<br></li><li> Handle challenges with your own play style; direct confrontation is not the only way to get things done!<br></li><li> <strong>Mods</strong> Using a deep but simple to understand data system, modders can easily create their own events and storylines.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Arcana Noir is an illustrated text-based Rogue-lite RPG using a D100 system, resource management, and decision trees inspired by adventure games and interactive fiction.",
